      python ..\..\i76-everywhere\i76-save-editor.py --dir <gamedir> --list

  Flow (all coordinates calibrated, see lib/maplib.ps1):
    intro skip -> TRIP -> LOAD BOOKMARK -> SCENE 5 -> LOAD
